# Uzbek Language Content Rule

## Overview
All user-facing content must be written in Uzbek language. Technical configurations, code structure, and naming conventions remain in English.

## Use Uzbek for:
- Button labels (e.g., "Kirish", "Chiqish", "Saqlash", "Bekor qilish")
- Form labels and placeholders (e.g., "Elektron pochta", "Parol", "Ism")
- Page titles and headings
- Navigation menu items
- Error messages and notifications
- Success messages
- Tooltips and help text
- Table headers
- Modal titles and content
- Empty state messages
- Confirmation dialogs

## Keep English for:
- Route names (e.g., `/login`, `/dashboard`, `/users`)
- Folder and file names (e.g., `components/`, `page.tsx`)
- Variable and function names
- CSS class names
- Environment variables
- API endpoint paths
- Database field names
- Configuration keys
- Code comments (optional, can be English or Uzbek)

## Common Uzbek Translations

### Authentication
- Login → Kirish
- Logout → Chiqish
- Register → Ro'yxatdan o'tish
- Password → Parol
- Email → Elektron pochta
- Forgot password → Parolni unutdingizmi?
- Remember me → Meni eslab qol

### Actions
- Save → Saqlash
- Cancel → Bekor qilish
- Delete → O'chirish
- Edit → Tahrirlash
- Add → Qo'shish
- Search → Qidirish
- Filter → Filtrlash
- Submit → Yuborish
- Confirm → Tasdiqlash
- Back → Orqaga
- Next → Keyingi
- Previous → Oldingi

### Common UI
- Dashboard → Boshqaruv paneli
- Settings → Sozlamalar
- Profile → Profil
- Users → Foydalanuvchilar
- Home → Bosh sahifa
- Loading → Yuklanmoqda...
- Error → Xatolik
- Success → Muvaffaqiyat
- Warning → Ogohlantirish
- No data → Ma'lumot yo'q

### Form Validation
- Required field → Majburiy maydon
- Invalid email → Noto'g'ri elektron pochta
- Password too short → Parol juda qisqa
- Passwords don't match → Parollar mos kelmaydi

## Example

```tsx
// Correct: Uzbek content, English code structure
export default function LoginPage() {
  return (
    <div>
      <h1>Kirish</h1>
      <form>
        <Input placeholder="Elektron pochta" />
        <Input placeholder="Parol" type="password" />
        <Button type="submit">Kirish</Button>
      </form>
    </div>
  );
}
```
